To identify element we use in Selenium two methods
----------------------------------------------
1.findElement()
----------------------------
- findElement() it identify single element
- findElement() returns WebElement interface object
- If element not found then this method throws exception NoSuchElementException

2.findElements()
----------------------------------------
- findElements() is identify multiple elements
- findElements() returns List<WebElement>
- If elements not found then this method never throws exception
You will get [] list and size will be 0
